  "description": {
    "text": "The Battle de Get! Summer Vacation Battle Campaign 2010 (バトルでゲット！なつやすみ対戦キャンペーン2010) ran at Gym Challenge shops from 1 to 31 August 2010. Players earned points on a stamp card: one for joining, one for each match (up to ten a day), one to five for LEGEND series products bought at the shop, and one a day when two opponents could tell the shop staff each other's names. Five points brought Porygon 077/L-P and fifteen Porygon2 078/L-P, both drawn by TOKIYA with the Gym Challenge logo on their picture, exchanged at the shop by 5 September 2010.",
